  V4 -- END-TO-END validation against a PUBLISHED number g04 never used: Park's 2% boost bound
  Park+2026 abstract: the Q_2 constraint 'imposes an upper bound of only 2% (at 95% confidence) on the
  MOND boost to the galactic radial acceleration ... at the position of the Sun'.  That boost is nu(e_N):
