  eq-(10) prefactor or the a_0 scaling were wrong, this reconstruction would miss.
  Q_2 = 5.2e-27 s^-2 is reached at a_0 = 1.587e-11, where e_N = 13.16 and the boost
  nu(e_N) - 1 = 2.73%   <-->   Park+2026's published 2% at 95% confidence.
